’ is selected",description:"Helper text shown when strict source mode is enabled, explaining why the other source controls are hidden"},newBadge:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.new-badge",defaultMessage:"New",description:"Badge label shown next to newly enabled apps (enabled by admin within the last 30 days and not yet connected by the user)"},viewMore:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.view-more",defaultMessage:"View more",description:"Entry at the bottom of the filter popup list to view more options"},viewMoreModalTitle:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.view-more-modal-title",defaultMessage:"Sources & apps",description:"Title of the View More modal dialog showing available sources and apps"},viewMoreConnectedApps:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.view-more-connected-apps",defaultMessage:"Connected apps",description:"Side nav item for Connected apps in the View More modal"},searchSettingsPlaceholder:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.search-settings-placeholder",defaultMessage:"Search settings",description:"Placeholder for the search box in the View More modal side nav"},rovoSettingsHeader:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.rovo-settings-header",defaultMessage:"Rovo Settings",description:"Common header for the content section in the View More modal"},connectedAppsDescription:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.connected-apps-description",defaultMessage:"Manage web results and company knowledge sources.",description:"Description for the Connected apps section in the View More modal"},connectedAppsOutOfTotal:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.connected-apps-out-of-total",defaultMessage:"{connectedCount} of your {totalCount} apps are connected",description:"Summary in the Connected apps modal: how many sources are connected versus the total shown"},connectMoreApps:{id:"ai-mate.chat-input.mode.menu.connect-more-apps",defaultMessage:"Connect more",description:"Button next to the connected summary; scrolls to the list of apps available to connect"},appsAvailableToConnectSect